                "loc": "REV.11.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Apu 11:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi ketolom alaro nakokina, erot loebei agolitomei: ketoloma agola naetereikina aibois naetiakaritai, ido naetereikina aduket kowai loka agolitomei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aojau naka aduket nakejai owai loka agolitomei kerai ikubitin akwatat, ka alalauke da ikubitin akaisakany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atercikina ikubitin akaisaarei luka alaro nakotoma ka atereikina etut loka alaro nakokina, keiai ebalasa atcreikina ebalasa eee kaiculeta auni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido kinaren kagolai ajai erot toma, alalauke ikubitin itomon; erot loka ikubitin akwatat, ketereikina ikekiakee agolitomei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido agolai nukokuju keraas nuewuriaka aitelekarit: naarai elikorito ibalasan apakikee, aitelekar apak naka kwa nukokwap, ka nukokidin, kotoma aduket, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai keiaas aieuleta auni, ido kemameete ipirin kwape ipirin luka alaro: kanuka nun adidin nakokuiu aitelekarit nakokwap, ka nakokidin anyoun kokwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arwatat nakejai kina naedunyasi kagolai, atereikina alaro nakokina asesena kagolai, aojauke ikubitin akaisakany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai aojau naka agolai nukejaas alaro nakokina kerai ikubitin akaisakany: kwa nuatereikina eyekalu keraas ikubitin akwatat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido kwap kagolai nun ajai alomaret kowai lokokide, nailomaria tomakee anyoun kalaro nakokina, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotoma abures naka arwatat naka alaro atereikina kide, koiŋaren kaibois naetiakaritai, koinaren da naka aduket, kejaas agolai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
