                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodi katema eoŋ atiar, “Agolai nuka agolitomei ka agolai nuka eŋalakimak, nuetereikina aibois naetiakaritai, ŋun kes agolai nukalaunak, nuenyamanakinete isasedotin lueapias ka EJAKAIT iboro lukalaunak noi: nen ibwaanakinete iboro lukalaunak noi, ainakineta nuka akiria, ka ainakineta nuka adiakar, ka ainakineta da nuka aronis; naarai aibois nin erai nakalaunan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
